# Format After Changes

After making any changes in this repo, run the formatter before finishing:

```bash
mvn -q spotless:apply
```

- Run it once after your final edit, not after every individual edit.
- Spotless covers Java under `src/main/java` and `src/test/java`, plus `pom.xml`, `config/**`, resource `.properties`/`.xml`, `scripts/**/*.sh`, and root `*.md`.
- Formatter settings live in `config/formatter/`; don't hand-format against them.
- If `spotless:apply` fails, report the error rather than skipping it.
